{
  "plan": {
    "version": "0.1",
    "title": "长方形的面积与平方单位",
    "goals": [
      "理解面积是用单位正方形覆盖平面区域的测量概念",
      "通过行列网格推导长方形面积公式：面积 = 长 × 宽",
      "正确运用平方单位，并有效区分面积与周长的概念区别"
    ],
    "teaching_strategies": [
      "直观演示单位正方形在网格中的充填过程",
      "从数方格计数过渡到乘法模型",
      "对比网格覆盖（面积）与周长边框（周长）的区别"
    ],
    "numbers": [
      {
        "initial": 5,
        "min": 1,
        "max": 8,
        "label": "每行方格数（长）",
        "unit": "厘米",
        "student_control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 1
        }
      },
      {
        "initial": 3,
        "min": 1,
        "max": 8,
        "label": "行数（宽）",
        "unit": "厘米",
        "student_control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 1
        }
      }
    ],
    "sections": [
      {
        "purpose": "建立面积的概念：用单位正方形覆盖平面区域的大小",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "note"
          },
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "visual",
            "capability": "rectangle_unit_square_array"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "当我们测量一个平面图形的大小，本质上是在用标准的小正方形去无缝铺满它。这里每一个小方格都是 1 平方厘米的单位正方形。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "visual",
                "timing": "before_speech",
                "content": {
                  "capability": "rectangle_unit_square_array",
                  "numbers": [
                    1,
                    2
                  ]
                },
                "role": "main_visual",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "new_region"
                },
                "reusable_item": 2
              },
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "note",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "title": "面积的定义",
                  "items": [
                    "用单位正方形无缝覆盖区域的大小",
                    "单位：1 平方厘米 (cm²)"
                  ]
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "explanation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "引导观察单位正方形在图形中的排列",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "尝试改变长方形的长和宽，观察小正方形是如何网格化覆盖整个平面的。",
            "delivery": "encouraging",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "point_at",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "reference": {
                  "source": "local_board_item",
                  "moment": 1,
                  "item": 1
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "student_activities": [
          {
            "kind": "number_target",
            "prompt": "将每行方格数调整为 6 厘米",
            "hints": [
              "滑动长（列数）对应的滑块",
              "将数值调至 6"
            ],
            "success_message": "很好！你成功改变了长方形的长。",
            "hint_after_attempts": 2,
            "number_controls": [
              {
                "number": 1,
                "controls": [
                  "slider"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "value": 5.995,
            "tolerance": 0.5
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "purpose": "探索长方形网格中每行方格数、行数与方格总数的关系",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "math"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "现在，我们用边长为1厘米的小正方形来铺满这个长方形。请注意观察它的排列方式。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "before_speech",
                "intent": "聚焦长方形内的方格网格排列",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "首先看横向：沿长边方向，每行刚好可以摆放5个小正方形，这就对应长方形的长是5厘米。",
            "delivery": "neutral",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "animate",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "number": 1,
                "end_value": 5,
                "duration_intent": "normal",
                "easing": "linear"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "再看纵向：沿宽边方向，一共可以摆放3行，这就对应长方形的宽是3厘米。",
            "delivery": "neutral",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "animate",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "number": 2,
                "end_value": 3,
                "duration_intent": "normal",
                "easing": "linear"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "要求出铺满这个长方形一共需要多少个小正方形，我们可以用每行的个数乘以行数，也就是 5 乘以 3 等于 15 个。",
            "delivery": "encouraging",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "5 \\times 3 = 15\\text{ (个)}"
                },
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "5 \\times 3 = 15"
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 4,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "point_at",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "reference": {
                  "source": "reusable",
                  "section": 1,
                  "item": 2
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "purpose": "推导面积计算公式“面积 = 长 × 宽”并规范使用平方单位",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "math"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "观察前面的网格，每行有5个1平方厘米的正方形，表示长是5厘米；有3行，表示宽是3厘米。所以小正方形的总个数就是5乘3等于15个。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "引导观察长方形网格的长宽与单位正方形数量的对应关系",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "我们可以将这个规律推广到任意长方形：每行方格数就等于长，行数就等于宽。因此，长方形的面积等于长乘以宽。",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "S = a \\times b"
                },
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 2,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "\\text{长方形面积} = \\text{长} \\times \\text{宽}"
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 2,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "after_speech",
                "intent": "强调长方形面积计算公式",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "请试着调整滑动条，把长设为 6 厘米，宽设为 4 厘米，看看面积是多少平方厘米吧！",
            "delivery": "encouraging",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 2,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                ],
                "intent": "继续观察当前画面",
                "timing": "after_speech"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "student_activities": [
          {
            "kind": "number_target",
            "prompt": "请将长拖动设置为 6 厘米",
            "hints": [
              "拖动第一个滑动条",
              "使每行方格数达到 6"
            ],
            "success_message": "很好！长已经设为 6 厘米。",
            "hint_after_attempts": 2,
            "number_controls": [
              {
                "number": 1,
                "controls": [
                  "slider"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "value": 5.995,
            "tolerance": 0.5
          },
          {
            "kind": "number_target",
            "prompt": "请将宽拖动设置为 4 厘米",
            "hints": [
              "拖动第二个滑动条",
              "使行数达到 4"
            ],
            "success_message": "太棒了！长方形面积为 6×4=24 平方厘米！",
            "hint_after_attempts": 2,
            "number_controls": [
              {
                "number": 2,
                "controls": [
                  "slider"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "value": 4.015,
            "tolerance": 0.5
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "purpose": "借助图形对比区分长方形的面积（内部覆盖）与周长（外围长度）",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "note"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "大家常把面积和周长搞混。现在请看屏幕上的长方形，它的长是 5 厘米，宽是 3 厘米。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "引导关注长方形的尺寸与整体形态",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "周长指的是围成这个长方形一周的线条总长度。把四条边加起来，长加宽再乘以二，得到周长是 16 厘米。",
            "delivery": "neutral",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "animate",
                "timing": "before_speech",
                "number": 1,
                "end_value": 5,
                "duration_intent": "brief",
                "easing": "linear"
              },
              {
                "action": "animate",
                "timing": "before_speech",
                "number": 2,
                "end_value": 3,
                "duration_intent": "brief",
                "easing": "linear"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "而面积则是指长方形内部平面的大小，也就是能铺满多少个 1 平方厘米的小正方形。这里是 5 乘以 3，等于 15 平方厘米。",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "对比内部覆盖与边界围成的区别",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "总结来说：周长是外围一圈的“线”，单位是长度单位厘米；面积是内部覆盖的“面”，单位是面积单位平方厘米。",
            "delivery": "encouraging",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "note",
                "timing": "after_speech",
                "content": {
                  "title": "面积与周长的区别",
                  "items": [
                    "周长：封闭图形一周的长度（边界线），单位：厘米(cm)",
                    "面积：物体的表面或封闭图形的大小（内部面），单位：平方厘米(cm²)"
                  ]
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "explanation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 3,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "student_activities": [
          {
            "kind": "number_target",
            "prompt": "将长设为 6 厘米，观察周长与面积的变化。",
            "hints": [
              "拖动长对应的滑块到 6",
              "此时周长变长，内部小方格也变多了"
            ],
            "success_message": "非常好！长变大后，周长（周边的线）和面积（内部的格数）都相应增加了。",
            "hint_after_attempts": 2,
            "number_controls": [
              {
                "number": 1,
                "controls": [
                  "slider"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "value": 5.995,
            "tolerance": 0.5
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "close": {
      "summary": "本课程从单位正方形铺满区域直观引入面积含义，通过网格行与列的排列推导出长方形面积公式“面积 = 长 × 宽”，明确了平方单位的意义，并清析地区分了面积与周长的本质差异。",
      "focus": [
        {
          "source": "reusable",
          "section": 1,
          "item": 2
        }
      ]
    }
